node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 722
  s text Classic Trance Supersaw Anthem Lead Synth. Iconic late-90s euphoric trance lead synthesizer with 7 detuned unison saw oscillators, cascading 24dB resonant lowpass filter with envelope modulation, high-shelf air, and subtle chorus stereo width.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
cable out 0 pic
